[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2702.549, "timestamp": "00:45:02", "text": "比如东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2704.91, "timestamp": "00:45:04", "text": "为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2709.03, "timestamp": "00:45:09", "text": "嗯，就像说，呃，你会把它放在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2716.309, "timestamp": "00:45:16", "text": "我知道这些是衣服"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2725.71, "timestamp": "00:45:25", "text": "这里不不，我把厨房用的衣服都放在这里了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2728.349, "timestamp": "00:45:28", "text": "像那样的衣服，不，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2740.23, "timestamp": "00:45:40", "text": "顶部……呃，这是什么？呃，一个餐具……呃，一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2743.95, "timestamp": "00:45:43", "text": "所以，为了这把铲子，我会保留它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2754.63, "timestamp": "00:45:54", "text": "盘子里的盐，好的，我们需要，我们会安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2757.82, "timestamp": "00:45:57", "text": "别担心，不要"}]